&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our Driver may be autonomous, but Waymo&#39;s finances are steered by experts like you. The Finance and Accounting group manages all aspects of our finances and serves as trusted advisors for all our strategic and enterprise endeavors. Along with managing compilation of our financial statements, looking after our cash and overseeing compliance, we partner closely with the business in overseeing company wide resource allocation, developing cutting edge compensation initiatives and generating detailed financial analyses to drive the business forward. We also develop advanced capital strategies to support the company&#39;s short- and long-term future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to the Accounting Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute key areas of the month-end and quarter-end close, preparing financial statements, supporting schedules, and footnotes/disclosures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform monthly and quarterly flux analysis and financial analytics, developing detailed reporting packages for leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and stabilize operational processes based on business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify control gaps and implementa operational improvements, automations and support system implemetnations across key accounting processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct technical accounting research and draft documentation for review on complex accounting transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with busoness partners such as Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis, Legal, Accounts Payable, Systems team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified Public Accountant (CPA) designation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience at a Big 4 Firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of US GAAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, organizational skills; and ability to multitask in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work in a cross-functional, fast-paced environment, and to lead and drive complex initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in technical accounting research and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the tech industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SAP Cloud, Systems implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Business Development and Partnerships team helps plan Waymo’s dynamic future and drive the company’s go-to-market strategy. We work cross-functionally and leverage quantitative and qualitative analysis to build forward-looking partnerships that deliver on Waymo’s strategic business objectives. As a member of this entrepreneurial and results-oriented team, you will have a significant impact on defining, developing and executing Waymo’s commercial deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The Waymo for Business team is bringing the power of Waymo to corporations. We are a new, fast moving team focused on B2B partnerships, offering Waymo&#39;s autonomous rideshare service to corporate clients for commute programs, business travel, and special events. As a founding member of the sales team, you will focus on mid-market and enterprise accounts and be responsible for building our customer base from the ground up. You will manage a complete sales cycle and help to define the GTM motion for a new category of corporate transportation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to a Senior Strategic Partnerships Development Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a revenue target and all aspects of the sales cycle from first touch (inbound and outbound) through to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on Mid Market and Enterprise customers (500+ employees), with an ability to flex up and down to all customer segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer onboarding and launch coordination for your accounts, ensuring a successful launch and revenue generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop sales collateral, proposals, and presentations to effectively position Waymo for Business, and continuously drive process improvements that optimize sales productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform product roadmaps and features by gathering customer feedback. Provide market insights that strengthen our value proposition and enhance the customer experience,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of Account Executive/closing experience in B2B tech sales, with a history of exceeding quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An extreme ownership mentality and bias for action. You are excited to build a new product and sales motion from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex commercial-stage requirements including security, legal, and procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to excel at outbound pipeline generation and full-cycle sales motions, including discovery, demo and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to present confidently and build connections across all customer levels, from ICs to C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Salesforce or similar CRM tools to track customer activity, pipeline, and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing consumption based technology solutions where revenue is tied to platform adoption or usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong adaptability and comfort operating in an environment where playbooks and workflows are actively evolving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$144,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$177,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wherever Waymo works, Business Support teams are on the job. We&#39;re the partners who plan events, work with external partners, and orchestrate the daily activities of our teams and leaders, the real estate specialists who find and build amazing workspaces and research facilities; the systems experts who develop and run our intuitive IT and business tools. Together, we do everything it takes to keep Waymo rolling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report into Executive Team Leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently execute essential administrative functions, including travel, expenses, confidential calendar management, and facilities coordination with limited guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively solve problems, exercising sound judgment and discretion even with limited information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively and build trust with executives, cross-functional partners (e.g., HR, Finance, Chief of Staff), and teams across the organization to achieve complex objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize strong communication and interpersonal skills to build rapport, influence collaboration, and engage effectively with diverse internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and deliver medium-to-large scale projects or events from initiation through completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence collaboration between Waymonauts and build rapport, positively impacting team velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience providing direct executive support, project management, or event planning to senior leaders (VP+) within a fast-paced technology or startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex scheduling and logistics with external partners, demonstrating responsiveness, flexibility, and sound judgment with confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational, time management, and prioritization skills with the ability to manage multiple complex tasks in a dynamic setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills: Proven ability to build strong relationships, collaborate effectively across diverse teams/functions, and maintain strict confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, analytical problem-solving skills, and the ability to adapt effectively to different leadership styles and partnership dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech Proficiency: Demonstrated ability to leverage technology for increased efficiency and quickly adopt new tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Leadership &amp;amp; Operational Problem Solving: Proven ability to lead projects, manage processes, and independently resolve operational issues through strategic thinking and data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Requirement: &lt;/strong&gt;Occasional travel, while rare, might be needed to support a combination of partnership and internal onsite support at other locations (domestic and international).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The expected hourly range for this position is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level.&amp;nbsp; Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Hourly Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$51.45&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$64.91 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Waymo&#39;s Supply Chain and Manufacturing teams are making the technology of the future a reality. We handle all production processes and supplier development strategies: from contracts and purchasing, to designs for improved manufacturing, through quality control and delivery. We collaborate actively with Waymo engineering teams as well as external suppliers and partners to make sure everything is built to spec and delivered on time to meet the rising demands of our business.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role follows a hybrid work schedule and you will report to the Head of Global Aftermarket Distribution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for global demand forecasting, planning &amp;amp; purchasing for all aftermarket/service parts across all the markets Waymo operates in with the goal to minimize downtime of vehicles caused due to parts availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the first point of contact for all Waymo’s service centers globally whether operated by Waymo or Waymo’s fleet operating partners on any topic related to Aftermarket parts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate supply plans to all of Waymo’s suppliers globally including our OEM partners and align on supply fulfillment plan to ensure there are no shortages in parts supply&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build complex models including AI Agents for forecasting, reports &amp;amp; analyses. These will be inputs to presentations that you will prepare and present on behalf of the Aftermarket team at executive reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our Warehousing team and 3PL managing the warehouses to ensure close collaboration between Planning &amp;amp; Warehousing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage key aftermarket operations with the potential to build and lead a dedicated team of direct reports as business needs evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree required with 10+ years of work experience as a Demand and Supply Planner or a similar role in high-tech or automotive companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to break down and solve problems through quantitative thinking and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity, strategic thinking and strong project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively in a team and create an inclusive environment with people at all levels of an organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively, both verbally and in writing, in English with the ability to adjust your style to suit different perspectives and seniority levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguous, ever-changing situations and exceptional time management to meet your responsibilities in a complex and largely autonomous work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization capabilities, including the ability to initiate tasks independently and see them through to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post graduate degree with excellent academic record; MBA, PhD or relevant advanced professional degree is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vast knowledge in SAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding background is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior management consulting experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership capability or prior people management experience, with a passion for developing direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As needed to visit suppliers, warehouses or partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$247,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Business Systems team defines and builds the business IT architecture that supports the commercial operation of Waymo&#39;s autonomous fleet. The team stands at the intersection of finance, operations and IT; through creative architecture, expertise and attention to detail, it ensures that Waymo has world-class capabilities across all its business processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Data Intelligence team is the strategic engine driving the democratization of AI across Waymo G&amp;amp;A. Operating at the unique intersection of cutting-edge Generative AI and corporate business strategy, we don&#39;t just build solutions in isolation we design, architect, and deploy intelligent, agentic systems that transform how Waymo operates. By bridging the gap between complex data and real-world business action, we empower G&amp;amp;A leaders (from Finance and Supply Chain to People Ops and Legal) to automate manual processes, scale operational efficiency, and make high-velocity, data-driven decisions as Waymo enters hyperscale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role follows a hybrid work schedule and reports to Data Intelligence Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Act as a domain authority in AI across G&amp;amp;A, mentoring team members, setting technical standards, and guiding leadership on AI investments and roadmap prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Develop and prototype solutions by building proof-of-concepts that leverage large language models (LLMs), agent frameworks, and workflow orchestration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Provide technical oversight by reviewing code and prompts, guiding system design decisions, and defining evaluation methodologies and performance benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Partner with business units to identify manual bottlenecks in Finance, HR, Sales, Supply Chain and Marketing applying AI to automate complex processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Oversee integration and deployment by ensuring seamless connectivity between AI agents and enterprise systems through APIs, data pipelines, and workflow platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS degree in Computer Science, or a related technical field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8-10 years of professional experience across data science, data engineering and business intelligence disciplines. 3+ years of technical experience with a focus on building and shipping AI/ML products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandatory hands-on experience using GenAI tools (vibe-coding) to turn prompts into small prototypes in a constrained environment, then use that artifact to validate requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Python and experience with modern AI/ML frameworks (e.g. LangChain, Vertex AI Agent Builder, TensorFlow, PyTorch) and cloud platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GCP, Vertex AI, A2A, MCP and ADK frameworks and their application in enterprise systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to articulate technical AI concepts to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise integrating AI and LLM solutions securely with major enterprise SaaS platforms (e.g., Salesforce, SAP, Workday, ServiceNow) in a complex, global corporate environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing advanced agentic patterns (e.g., multi-agent orchestration, complex RAG architectures, dynamic tool use) for automating multi-step, cross-platform business workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of influencing cross-functional leadership, driving technical strategy, and managing organizational change to ensure high user adoption of new AI tools across non-technical business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI governance, enterprise data privacy standards, and security protocols (e.g., RBAC, data loss prevention) when deploying AI applications on internal corporate data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate ambiguity and drive projects from conception to launch in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience acting as a technical multiplier—mentoring team members, setting engineering standards for AI tooling, and guiding leadership on AI investments and roadmap prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$247,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a data processing platform used by onboard and offboard teams to extract signals from petabytes of driving logs and simulation traces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build low-latency streaming data processing platform, enabling real-time identification of critical driving events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, scalability, and efficiency of our signal generation infrastructure, establishing SLOs and reducing operational toil for massive-scale data processing jobs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners in Perception, Planner, and Data Science to migrate legacy pipelines to modern infrastructure and support new analytical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS or MS in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or equivalent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in backend engineering, databases, and production monitoring (3+ years for L4, and relevant internship for L3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leading projects and driving collaborating with cross-functional teams (for L4 and L3, this is not required and can be moved to preferred below)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with general-purpose programming languages, especially C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;screenreader-hidden-offscreen&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comment start&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;with capacity planning, resource forecasting models, and cost attribution strategies for high-throughput or streaming data processing infrastructure.&lt;span class=&quot;screenreader-hidden-offscreen&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comment end&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with distributed processing frameworks (e.g. Hadoop, Flume, and Spark) with stream processing frameworks (e.g., Flink, Flume Streaming, Kafka).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving collaboration effectively across organizational boundaries, building multi-dimensional stakeholder relationships, and importing and exporting ideas to achieve broad organizational goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with infrastructure-as-code and reliability engineering practices (SLOs, error budgets)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
