&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Emergency Management, Homeland Security, Public Policy, Operations Management, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience) &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep knowledge of developing, publishing, and maintaining site-specific Emergency Action Plans and seamlessly integrating them into broader Business Continuity Plans &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
