&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of managing vendor operational rhythms, conducting performance reviews, and executing root-cause corrective action plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in process optimization and operational rigor (e.g., DMAIC, Kaizen, Lean) applied to external workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
