&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Automotive Engineering and Product Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience working in vehicle architecture and complete vehicle layout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to create and negotiate targets and requirements with OEMs and partner companies/suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating with clarity and capability when interfacing with Directors and VPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in an ambiguous world and find a path forward to resolve seemingly conflicting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
