&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; Master’s degree in Occupational Health and Safety, Environmental Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to present safety data as a business driver to C-suite executives, demonstrating how safety excellence supports overall operational velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
