&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Segmentation &amp;amp; Personalization:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage audience insights to build sophisticated segments, ensuring highly relevant content for diverse rider cohorts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with Product, Data Science, Product Marketing and Brand Marketing to ensure our message is consistent and supported across owned channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement: &lt;/strong&gt;Measure impact of campaigns, report on learnings and recommend strategic next steps to reach growth goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Creation: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the development of compelling, brand-aligned content and manage the technical setup of campaigns and creative assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
