&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leveraging data to drive expansion and managing end-to-end campaigns within fast-paced, dynamic settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical skills, including SQL proficiency for data extraction and audience segmentation, combined with the ability to assess experiment performance, promotion efficiency, and LTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with marketing automation platforms and model-based deployment; prior experience developing these systems in-house is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
