&lt;li&gt;BS degree in Computer Engineering or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of industry experience with SystemVerilog, RTL design and microarchitecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years designing and specifying microarchitectures of high performance computing cores (CPU/GPU/NPU)&lt;/li&gt;
