&lt;p&gt;The Demand Operations &amp;amp; Service Quality team drives conversion, retention and utilization within local markets via metrics design and oversight, issue mitigation, and key demand opportunities. The &lt;strong&gt;Ops Analyst, Demand Operations &amp;amp; Service Quality&lt;/strong&gt; will provide analytical and operational support across the entirety of the Demand Ops &amp;amp; Service Quality team, with a focus on understanding top rider pain points, building dashboards for Ops Managers to self-serve data, investigating escalated metrics, and supporting marketplace enablement.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the &lt;strong&gt;Head of Demand Operations &amp;amp; Service Quality.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
