&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5-10 years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in analytical roles, with a keen interest in advocating for the solutions your analysis produces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical rigor&lt;/strong&gt;: Exceptional data visualization, quantitative, and analytical modeling skills (e.g., expert level in SQL, Excel / Google Sheets required) and the ability to build data-driven business cases to make operational improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communication skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Exhibit comfort presenting to senior leadership and mastery in collaborating across stakeholder groups&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge between data &amp;amp; operations: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to bridge gaps between Data Science and Operations teams to ensure insights drive operational success and continuous improvement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity!&lt;/strong&gt; Unending curiosity about the metrics you set out to investigate and a desire to keep pulling the thread until you’ve figured out what’s going on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with Ambiguity:&lt;/strong&gt; Thrive in a &quot;0 to 1&quot; environment by bringing structure to messy, undefined data and building foundational reporting frameworks from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Multiplier:&lt;/strong&gt; Go beyond individual contribution by serving as our analytics expert and teaching our team how to effectively deploy AI tools to upskill and elevate our collective data literacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree (Business, Operations, Data Science, Mathematics or related field).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth technology or mobility company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level SQL skills to query and model complex datasets, with experience building intuitive, ad hoc dashboards for operational self-service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python, R, or similar statistical programming languages is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous leveraging data to drive operational improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in AV, mobility technology, urban planning or transportation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
