&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional leaders (Legal, Communications, Product, Safety) to align policy initiatives with core business objectives and protect Waymo&#39;s freedom to operate in key markets (CA, AZ, TX).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate and execute the comprehensive policy roadmap and strategic priorities for the Western U.S., including rigorous budget allocation and resource optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee state consultant networks and represent Waymo&#39;s interests as a leading voice in industry trade associations, coalitions, and public forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role reports directly in the Director of U.S. State and Local Policy and Public Policy Campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
