&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of state and local legislative processes and political dynamics in the Western U.S., supported by a deep, established network of political stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated capability to diplomatically translate complex technical and regulatory concepts into persuasive advocacy strategies for diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional executive communication, negotiation, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing substantial government affairs budgets, optimizing resources to achieve strategic policy victories.&lt;/li&gt;
