&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the business to design and implement new operational processes and accounting flows. Identify, scope, and resolve process gaps across your business area, driving consistency across stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the subject matter expert in Inventory and Supply Chain Accounting to support major system implementations, enhancements, and bug resolutions. Proactively find process efficiencies through elimination, automation, and strategic outsourcing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks, generate risk mitigation plans, and escalate issues when appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present complex financial and technical information clearly to various audiences, including finance leaders, cross-functional business partners, and internal/external auditors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 7+ years of progressive accounting experience. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
