&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business requirements into conceptual, logical, and physical data models.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define core data concepts for Waymo commercialization and implement models in the database.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain data warehouse and pipeline solutions. Bring in and transform raw data that can be easily used to generate reports and insights for Waymo’s commercialization tracking and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure proper handling of PII and ACL. Implement a data quality framework, and maintain documentation.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be highly collaborative and work closely with data producers and data consumers across Waymo to understand the data needs, provide consultation, and align data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
