&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in the field of software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in programming C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with building highly scalable distributed system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
