&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; Exercise strong technical judgment to contribute to tool/platform design discussions, evaluate architectural trade offs, and ensure deliverable quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; Release Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;: Coordinate releases, manage tool deployment, and oversee triage workflows for simulation platforms to ensure high reliability and usability for developer teams&lt;/li&gt;
