&lt;li&gt;Write end-to-end synthesizable transactors to interact with emulated designs through software APIs and C-DPI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and root-cause failures alongside emulation users, leveraging waveforms, software logging, and custom-built emulation monitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with post-silicon bring-up, debug, and characterization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build infrastructure to support the emulation user base, including tools for model build, regression, automation, continuous integration, data analysis, and training&lt;/li&gt;
