&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Baremetal or RTOS firmware development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with embedded architectures, IO technologies (e.g. PCIe, DRAM, AXI, etc.), and hardware/software interactions&lt;/li&gt;
