&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Interface with a diverse set of stakeholders, including hardware design engineers, failure analysis engineers, and diagnostic teams, to translate physical requirements into technical specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Bridge the gap between experimental ML models and high-scale production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
