&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience (typically 8+ years) in software engineering, with a focus on designing and building large-scale, complex distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in applied LLMs and Agentic AI development, with a proven track record of building multi-agent systems, reasoning engines, and autonomous workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
