&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2,0&quot;&gt;Strong coding and testing proficiency, specifically in Python and C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot;&gt;Strong foundational knowledge of model evaluation and core data science principles (e.g., confidence intervals, outlier identification, curve fitting, and causality analysis)&lt;/li&gt;
